	(text "Pin map (Zephyr overlay must match). SPI2/FSPI on IO10-13 is the LoRa bus; the LCD has its own SPI3 on\nIO43 (LCD_SCK) / IO44 (LCD_MOSI), so a frame refresh never holds up the radio. LCD CS is active high.\nNo UART0: console and logs go to USB-Serial-JTAG on J1. IO0 = Back key and BOOT strap: hold Back while switching on for\ndownload mode. IO45 (LCD_CS) and IO46 (BUZZER) are straps that must be low at reset: R404, R406.\nIO38-42 give up pin JTAG; debug over USB-Serial-JTAG. IO35-37 are spare (N16R2 has quad PSRAM).\nWake sources for light sleep: LORA_DIO1 (IO15), PWR_BTN (IO18), keys IO0-9 are all RTC GPIOs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 140.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
